<description>&lt;p&gt;JNIM militants have attacked 30 locations across Mali, expanding their strike pattern beyond earlier incidents. In Nigeria's Niger state, gunmen killed a village head, six others, and five worshippers in a mosque reprisal, while Fulani civilians were killed in retaliatory attacks after the village leader's murder. Benin is stepping up operations against jihadists near the Nigeria border. The Sahel jihadist insurgency caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNM0Fta1BkcGNCQ3ZRMmRYZ055QmhtMjNuQW83d0hUbWJEOGo3SmloTmdENnZmdFQwS0ptVlRFWGFocS1BNGhSNm1xMGdPdEpSVnA1Z0FjY0YwTkVObnctcS01WXRleXlxZUJNRk1zYU9YNlZRcFZJNm1OcklnczhRbzBfc1ROeFJDSmxhMm9LOUNBeEtEd3p2NVlfamo?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOMDZ2LXRrR2IwOUhZcE5yUjFjR0dEX0lvajJRbjhZc0s0aGR4aWlKR3JoeXBKUTEtY2ktaWxmMGlQYTVNVExrV25xN3VUMk1iZDgya3JaaDY4cjh6QXd1dTVPakQ0N3BCa0ZNT2txMjlsZFFHWFluenVmNjB5bk92UzE5TXo5SUZ4azhjb2tfclVwQzhzR2h0SU43ejNJY25RcTRwd0l4WlZvOXJqWjM5akJ4aGVRRlNGRjRwMnlBSE9qLVE2OFFraFdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNb3N0c2hxcjRmbjZWU3dGdUFTeG5KaEcwOE1wV1hxbE9VOGRBVnN2MlRVai1JY0J0Ym1kLVgwZ0x0Mlk4MWlxQVE3OE4wYkwxVFpIS2c1eDlCT0JnLUdURnlQLWxiQUFtWXgzR1JCVUJVSjlFMDRQMUFWN1FZT0dDSVg0U3ZNZkxuQmxQejJqNDlvOHY2YmRrTVI5aGRja0xWRkQwS2otbTYxOWRzMTJB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQUklwLTJCZktKV2hqOWlhaVVNUnVBRmNlTW83SVNZeHp2cGJPZ2FxZTg1SFdvVkxwdkdPWHhKSEZUYy1hY0xaaDVqWkJGd1g5WWRxUDRVZ3h4QUcxdk1vbU9FUVlMWmVCWUVGQjlhVnBzeHZfV25JQ1NSNmRMdlZxMmE0YTZOUjkzNlB2VHJOOFM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nacionale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&g